{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Cléo, Melvil et moi (I Hadn't Seen It That Way)","À Paris, dans la stupeur du premier confinement, Arnaud, séparé d’Isabelle et papa de Cléo et Melvil, va profiter de cette parenthèse pour prendre soin de ses enfants et faire le point sur sa vie, ce qui le conduit aux souvenirs mais aussi à l’avenir… L’avenir, c’est peut-être Marianne, la pharmacienne du quartier. Ses yeux sont verts, et derrière la vitre en plexiglas, une attirance va naître.",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"urban","independent home","fatherhood","romance","covid-19","desire","extended family",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":32,"media":36,"synopsis":39,"production":41,"characters":44,"roles":65,"awards":77,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_138","fr2023-138-cleo-melvil-et-moi",{"native":16,"english":17},"Cléo, Melvil et moi","I Hadn't Seen It That Way",{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2023-07-05",2023,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":31},"Arnaud Viard","arnaud-viard",1965,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[33,34,35],"Comedy","Drama","Romance",{"posterUrl":37,"trailerUrl":38},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/216/255/262104/format_page/cleo-melvil-et-moi.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w-BpNG7aXzs",{"native":2,"english":40},"",[42],{"country":30,"share":43},"Majority coproducer",[45,56],{"id":46,"film":13,"person":47,"age":49,"gender":29,"sexuality":50,"origin":51,"class":52,"profession":53,"ability":54,"assistedMobility":55},"FR2023_138_01",{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":48},[],"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","Heterosexual","White Western European","Middle class","Unknown","Able-bodied","No",{"id":57,"film":13,"person":58,"age":49,"gender":62,"sexuality":50,"origin":51,"class":52,"profession":64,"a